.TH YA 1 "2026-06-19" "yazi 26.5.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ya \- yazi command-line helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ya
.I <subcommand>
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ya
is the command-line companion to
.BR yazi (1).
It provides subcommands for managing yazi packages, emitting yazi events
from shell scripts, and other auxiliary operations.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B ya pack
Manage yazi plugins and themes (install, update, remove).
.TP
.B ya pub
Publish a DDS (data-distribution service) event to a running yazi instance.
.TP
.B ya pub-static
Publish a static event that persists across yazi restarts.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yazi (1),
.PP
Full documentation at
.IR https://yazi-rs.github.io .
